# CatDex — Release Checklist

## Before shipping

### Product
- [ ] Capture → analyze → reward → album works on target platform
- [ ] Auth + onboarding path still reaches map
- [ ] Map HUD capture gate + location banner OK

### Config
- [ ] `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_*` set for target
- [ ] `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` points at healthy HTTPS API
- [ ] Server has `OPENAI_API_KEY` + Supabase secrets
- [ ] OAuth redirect URLs allowlisted

### Quality
- [ ] Typecheck / server tests green
- [ ] No secrets in repo or client bundle
- [ ] Error states verified (API down, not a cat)

### Web beta (Netlify et al.)
- [ ] Production build (`dist` / EAS as applicable) deployed from intended branch (`main` / release)
- [ ] Smoke test on `catdex-beta` (or current host): welcome, login, map, scanner

### Mobile
- [ ] Follow `docs/MOBILE_DEPLOYMENT.md` / `TEST_ON_PHONE.md`
- [ ] Camera + location permissions copy still accurate

### Rollback
- [ ] Know previous deploy artifact / API revision
- [ ] Feature flags / env toggles documented if used
